  "mascots": [
    {
      "key": "zenith",
      "name": "Zenith",
      "bio": {
        "id": [
          "Sebuah robot yang visioner, presisi, dan berorientasi pada pencapaian tertinggi. Ia merepresentasikan kecerdasan tingkat lanjut yang fokus pada akurasi, stabilitas, dan pengambilan keputusan yang strategis. Dengan sifat tegas namun tenang, Zenith mampu menganalisis situasi secara menyeluruh dan bertindak dengan penuh perhitungan",
          "Zenith bukan hanya simbol teknologi canggih, tetapi juga keandalan dan kepemimpinan—menjadi representasi puncak performa, kemajuan, dan kepercayaan dalam setiap proses."
        ],
        "en": [
          "A visionary, precise robot oriented toward the highest achievement. It represents advanced intelligence focused on accuracy, stability, and strategic decision-making. Firm yet composed, Zenith can analyze situations thoroughly and act with careful consideration.",
          "Zenith is not just a symbol of advanced technology, but also of reliability and leadership — representing the peak of performance, progress, and trust in every process."
        ]
      },
      "scene_image": "img/Mascot/zenith_1.png",
      "profile_image": "img/Mascot/zenith_show.png"
    },
    {
      "key": "elio",
      "name": "Elio",
      "bio": {
        "id": [
          "Sebuah robot yang cerdas, ramah, dan penuh empati. Ia dirancang untuk responsif terhadap kebutuhan manusia, mampu beradaptasi dengan cepat, serta selalu mengedepankan efisiensi tanpa kehilangan sentuhan personal.",
          "Dengan karakter yang optimis dan komunikatif, Elio merepresentasikan teknologi yang bukan hanya pintar, tetapi juga dapat dipercaya, suportif, dan menyenangkan untuk diajak berinteraksi, menjadi partner yang membantu, bukan sekadar alat."
        ],
        "en": [
          "A robot that is intelligent, friendly, and full of empathy. It is designed to be responsive to human needs, able to adapt quickly, and always prioritizes efficiency without losing a personal touch.",
          "With an optimistic and communicative character, Elio represents technology that isn't just smart, but also trustworthy, supportive, and enjoyable to interact with — a helpful partner, not just a tool."
        ]
      },
      "scene_image": "img/Mascot/elio_nova_1.png",
      "profile_image": "img/Mascot/elio_show.png"
    },
    {
      "key": "aero",
      "name": "Aero",
      "bio": {
        "id": [
          "Sebuah robot yang gesit, adaptif, dan penuh semangat eksplorasi. Ia merepresentasikan kecepatan berpikir, fleksibilitas, serta kemampuan bergerak selaras dengan perubahan yang cepat. Dengan sifat komunikatif dan solutif, Aero selalu siap mencari cara paling efektif dan inovatif dalam menghadapi tantangan.",
          "Karakternya mencerminkan teknologi yang ringan namun bertenaga—cepat, cerdas, dan selalu selangkah lebih maju dalam mendukung produktivitas dan kreativitas."
        ],
        "en": [
          "A robot that is agile, adaptive, and full of exploratory spirit. It represents speed of thought, flexibility, and the ability to move in step with rapid change. With a communicative, solution-driven nature, Aero is always ready to find the most effective and innovative way to face challenges.",
          "Its character reflects technology that is light yet powerful — fast, smart, and always one step ahead in supporting productivity and creativity."
        ]
      },
      "scene_image": "img/Mascot/aero_1.png",
      "profile_image": "img/Mascot/aero_show.png"
    },
    {
      "key": "nova",
      "name": "Nova",
      "bio": {
        "id": [
          "Sebuah robot yang kreatif, visioner, dan membawa semangat pembaruan. Ia merepresentasikan ide-ide segar, keberanian untuk berinovasi, serta kemampuan melihat peluang di tengah perubahan.",
          "Dengan sifat hangat dan komunikatif, Nova mendorong kolaborasi dan pertumbuhan, sekaligus menghadirkan solusi yang relevan dan berdampak. Karakternya mencerminkan cahaya awal dari sebuah kemajuan, memberi inspirasi, arah baru, dan dorongan untuk terus berkembang."
        ],
        "en": [
          "A creative, visionary robot carrying a spirit of renewal. It represents fresh ideas, the courage to innovate, and the ability to spot opportunity amid change.",
          "With a warm, communicative nature, Nova drives collaboration and growth while delivering solutions that are relevant and impactful. Its character reflects the first light of progress — offering inspiration, new direction, and the push to keep growing."
        ]
      },
      "scene_image": null,
      "profile_image": "img/Mascot/nova_show.png"
    }
